{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34396","headline":"奉和袭美登初阳楼寄怀北平郎中 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美登初阳楼寄怀北平郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远窗浮槛亦成年，几伴杨公白昼筵。\n日暖烟花曾扑地，气浮星象却归天。\n闲将水石侵军垒，醉引笙歌上钓船。\n无限恩波犹在目，东风吹起细漪涟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34396.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34396","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}